<div class="info-modal" id="signin-info-modal" hidden>
    <button class="info-backdrop" type="button" data-info-close aria-label="Close information window"></button>
    <section class="info-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="info-modal-title" tabindex="-1">
        <header class="info-header">
            <div><p class="info-eyebrow">ASKPEARLS PORTAL</p><h2 id="info-modal-title">Help &amp; support</h2></div>
            <button class="info-close" type="button" data-info-close aria-label="Close">×</button>
        </header>
        <nav class="info-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Help and legal information">
            <button type="button" role="tab" id="info-tab-help" data-info-tab="help" aria-controls="info-panel-help" aria-selected="true">Help</button>
            <button type="button" role="tab" id="info-tab-terms" data-info-tab="terms" aria-controls="info-panel-terms" aria-selected="false">Terms</button>
            <button type="button" role="tab" id="info-tab-privacy" data-info-tab="privacy" aria-controls="info-panel-privacy" aria-selected="false">Privacy</button>
            <button type="button" role="tab" id="info-tab-contact" data-info-tab="contact" aria-controls="info-panel-contact" aria-selected="false">Contact support</button>
        </nav>
        <div class="info-content">
            <article id="info-panel-help" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="info-tab-help" data-info-panel="help">
                <h3>Sign in to your workspace</h3>
                <p>Use the Google account connected to your AskPearls workspace. First-time visitors can create their portal account by continuing with Google.</p>
                <div class="info-callout"><strong>Having trouble?</strong><p>Check that pop-ups are allowed, then try again. If you still need help, <button class="info-inline-trigger" type="button" data-info-open="contact">contact AskPearls support</button>.</p></div>
                <h4>What happens after sign-in?</h4><p>AskPearls verifies your Google account and opens your workspace. Your portal profile is created automatically on your first successful sign-in.</p>
            </article>
            <article id="info-panel-terms" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="info-tab-terms" data-info-panel="terms" hidden>
                <p class="info-draft-label">Terms of Service · Draft for review</p>
                <h3>Using the AskPearls portal</h3>
                <p>By signing in, you agree to use the portal lawfully and only for workspaces you are authorized to access. Keep your Google account secure and tell us if you suspect unauthorized access.</p>
                <h4>Workspace content</h4><p>You are responsible for the content and settings you add to your workspace, including questions, recommendations, and published widgets. Do not use the service to violate another person’s rights or applicable law.</p>
                <h4>Service availability</h4><p>Portal features may change as AskPearls improves the service. Contact support with questions about these draft terms.</p>
            </article>
            <article id="info-panel-privacy" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="info-tab-privacy" data-info-panel="privacy" hidden>
                <p class="info-draft-label">Privacy Policy · Draft for review</p>
                <h3>Your account information</h3>
                <p>When you continue with Google, AskPearls uses basic profile details such as your name and email address to create and secure your portal account.</p>
                <h4>How information is used</h4><p>Account details are used to identify you, provide access to your workspace, and support the portal. AskPearls does not receive your Google password through this sign-in flow.</p>
                <h4>Questions or requests</h4><p>For questions about your account information or a privacy request, contact your AskPearls support team.</p>
            </article>
            <article id="info-panel-contact" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="info-tab-contact" data-info-panel="contact" hidden>
                <h3>Contact AskPearls support</h3>
                <p>Tell us what you need help with. Our team will get back to you.</p>
                <form class="support-form" data-support-form>
                    <label for="support-name">Your name</label>
                    <input id="support-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Enter your name" required>
                    <label for="support-email">Email address</label>
                    <input id="support-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="Enter your email address" required>
                    <label for="support-message">How can we help?</label>
                    <textarea id="support-message" name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Describe the issue or question…" required></textarea>
                    <p class="support-form-note"><span aria-hidden="true">ⓘ</span>Please don’t include passwords or sensitive information.</p>
                    <button class="support-submit" type="submit">Send support request</button>
                    <p class="support-form-status" data-support-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
                    <button class="info-inline-trigger support-back" type="button" data-info-open="help">Back to help</button>
                </form>
            </article>
        </div>
        <footer class="info-footer"><span>Need more help?</span><button class="info-inline-trigger" type="button" data-info-open="contact">Contact AskPearls support</button></footer>
    </section>
</div>
